('শ্রেষ্ঠ কিশোরগল্প', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Srestho_Kishorgolpo-Syed_Shamsul_Haque-5b04a-389718.jpg', 'সৈয়দ শামসুল হক', 'তাম্রলিপি', 'বয়স যখন ৮-১২: গল্প', '9789849873785', 'বাংলা', 136, '1st Published, 2024', 300.0, 249, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', '"কবি-সব্যসাচী লেখক সৈয়দ শামসুল হক। তিনি নেই, তাঁর লেখা আছে, থাকবে হয়তো অনন্তকাল। সাহিত্যের সকল শাখায় তাঁর স্বাচ্ছন্দ্য বিচরণ ছিল। শিশু কিশোরদের জন্যও তাঁর অসামান্য প্রচুর লেখা রয়েছে। সেখান থেকে মাত্র কয়েকটা গল্প নিয়ে বর্তমান সংকলন শ্রেষ্ঠ কিশোর গল্প। বইটি কিশোরদের নিশ্চিত মনোরঞ্জন জোগাবে।" Show More'),
('Stanzas of summer And Spring', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/imgrok0711_33344.GIF', 'Syed Shamsul Haque', 'Adorn Publication', 'English Poem', '9789842003394', 'English', 78, '1st Published, 2013', 170.0, 146, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', NULL),
('Hudsons Gun', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/b59c1ee95_155423.jpg', 'Syed Shamsul Haque', 'Panjeree Publications', 'Contemporary Novel', '9789849295402', 'English', 127, '1st Published, 2017', 270.0, 239, '65% Off', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'December in London. Bone chilling cold. On top of that, a bitter northern wind had been blowing ceaselessly for the past couple of days. The wind was even visible to the naked like a moving bluish haze that spread over everything. The wind, rushing all the way from the frigid Tundra, was stabbing every part of the body with the severity of a sharp knife. As if this wasn''t enough, snow had begun to fall from midnight without a break. All around, one could only see the white expanse of the winter snow. That particular morning, the city''s houses and streets outside the hotel window looked like a painted picture from a Christmas card. For the past three weeks, Hotel Seacock in London''s Paddington area had been hosting a famous Bangladeshi painter, Nayan Choudhury. Show More'),
